WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.541 --> 00:00:33.083
<b>In the previous verse, </b>
<b>Lord Krishna described the person</b>

2
00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:38.125
<b>who has renounced the selfishness </b>
<b>and all the desires of the mind.</b>

3
00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:38.916
<b>But</b>

4
00:00:38.916 --> 00:00:40.458
<b>the question arises,</b>

5
00:00:40.458 --> 00:00:43.000
<b>if there are no desires at all,</b>

6
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.166
<b>no aspirations from this world,</b>

7
00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:49.791
<b>then what is the need to perform actions?</b>

8
00:00:49.791 --> 00:00:52.708
<b>This is what is mentioned in this verse.</b>

9
00:00:57.583 --> 00:00:58.750
<b>Desires,</b>

10
00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.000
<b>aspirations,</b>

11
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.916
<b>these are all related to the fruit of actions.</b>

12
00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:05.833
<b>In this verse, Lord Krishna states that</b>

13
00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:12.791
<b>one should constantly perform actions </b>
<b>as a duty without being attached to the fruit.</b>

14
00:01:12.791 --> 00:01:13.833
<b>But then,</b>

15
00:01:13.833 --> 00:01:15.083
<b>in such a case,</b>

16
00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:17.375
<b>what will be the motivation of that person?</b>

17
00:01:17.375 --> 00:01:21.291
<b>Ultimately, there must be some result,</b>

18
00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:23.291
<b>some significance to this kind of duty?</b>

19
00:01:23.291 --> 00:01:29.125
<b>Krishna says that this kind of duty mentality,</b>
<b>far from attachment to the fruit,</b>

20
00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:32.916
<b>ultimately paves the way for spiritual liberation,</b>

21
00:01:32.916 --> 00:01:40.166
<b>and that person ultimately attains the </b>
<b>highest state of complete spiritual realization.</b>

22
00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:45.541
<b>This path is also suitable for </b>
<b>those who have renounced desires</b>

23
00:01:45.541 --> 00:01:46.333
<b>but</b>

24
00:01:46.333 --> 00:01:50.166
<b>have not yet reached the</b>
<b>depths of knowledge yoga.</b>

25
00:01:50.166 --> 00:01:56.208
<b>They too can attain spiritual perfection</b>
<b>through such duty fulfillment.</b>

26
00:01:56.208 --> 00:02:01.666
<b>Now the question may arise that </b>
<b>spiritual perfection is a long process,</b>

27
00:02:01.666 --> 00:02:05.625
<b>it may take more than one lifetime to attain it.</b>

28
00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:09.166
<b>Perhaps it may be attained in some next birth,</b>

29
00:02:09.166 --> 00:02:12.666
<b>so is there no result in this birth?</b>

30
00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:16.208
<b>We have to understand this</b>
<b>in a slightly different way.</b>

31
00:02:16.208 --> 00:02:20.583
<b>If the destination of a journey is going </b>
<b>to be extremely pleasant,</b>

32
00:02:20.583 --> 00:02:23.500
<b>then that journey also gives us joy.</b>

33
00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:27.083
<b>We are progressing towards a </b>
<b>beautiful spiritual destination,</b>

34
00:02:27.083 --> 00:02:30.875
<b>this consciousness will also delight us in this life,</b>

35
00:02:30.875 --> 00:02:32.458
<b>keep us away from sorrow,</b>

36
00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:34.083
<b>keep us cheerful.</b>

37
00:02:34.083 --> 00:02:35.208
<b>All this will happen.</b>

38
00:02:35.208 --> 00:02:36.833
<b>It will happen in this very birth.</b>

39
00:02:36.833 --> 00:02:38.875
<b>It will happen on its own.</b>

40
00:02:43.125 --> 00:02:50.250
<b>Here one must understand duty </b>
<b>and its spiritual impact.</b>

41
00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:55.583
<b>See your daily activities and </b>
<b>responsibilities not as a burden,</b>

42
00:02:55.583 --> 00:03:01.708
<b>but as an opportunity for spiritual</b>
<b>growth and self-realization.</b>

43
00:03:01.708 --> 00:03:05.958
<b>Perform each action with a </b>
<b>sense of duty and devotion,</b>

44
00:03:05.958 --> 00:03:11.958
<b>knowing that it will lead you</b>
<b>towards self-satisfaction.</b>

45
00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:14.500
<b>By adopting this perspective,</b>

46
00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:21.125
<b>you can free yourself from the stress </b>
<b>and worries of external expectations.</b>

47
00:03:21.125 --> 00:03:26.541
<b>Instead of waiting for others' </b>
<b>approval and recognition,</b>

48
00:03:26.541 --> 00:03:33.166
<b>you will start finding satisfaction in </b>
<b>honestly fulfilling your responsibilities.</b>

49
00:03:33.166 --> 00:03:34.375
<b>Moreover,</b>

50
00:03:34.375 --> 00:03:38.541
<b>when you let go of your attachment to results,</b>

51
00:03:38.541 --> 00:03:47.000
<b>you also prepare yourself to establish a deep</b>
<b>connection with the soul and the Supreme Soul.</b>

52
00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:51.958
<b>The sense of duty and every </b>
<b>responsibility fulfilled selflessly</b>

53
00:03:51.958 --> 00:03:58.208
<b>will create a feeling of inner peace </b>
<b>and harmony within you.</b>

54
00:03:58.208 --> 00:04:02.208
<b>Essentially, the practice of </b>
<b>performing duties without expectations</b>

55
00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:06.125
<b>makes your life more purposeful.</b>

56
00:04:06.125 --> 00:04:10.875
<b>Through this practice, you not only </b>
<b>achieve personal growth</b>

57
00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:12.208
<b>but</b>

58
00:04:12.208 --> 00:04:19.708
<b>also pave the way for a </b>
<b>deep relationship with the Divine.</b>

59
00:04:19.708 --> 00:04:21.416
<b>Think about it.</b>

60
00:04:26.083 --> 00:04:30.375
<b>Imagine a different kind of society today.</b>

61
00:04:30.375 --> 00:04:39.125
<b>Imagine a society where everyone performs </b>
<b>their duty without worrying about any gain,</b>

62
00:04:39.125 --> 00:04:43.625
<b>and where people's goal is not material pleasure,</b>

63
00:04:43.625 --> 00:04:46.125
<b>but spiritual fulfillment.</b>

64
00:04:46.125 --> 00:04:47.750
<b>How would this society be,</b>

65
00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:52.000
<b>where all people will work together peacefully,</b>

66
00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:57.166
<b>improving their community </b>
<b>with each other's help.</b>

67
00:04:57.166 --> 00:05:08.166
<b>In such a society, everyone will be aware that their </b>
<b>actions affect not only themselves but also others.</b>

68
00:05:08.166 --> 00:05:11.333
<b>Here, no one will work for themselves,</b>

69
00:05:11.333 --> 00:05:15.583
<b>but will do it with a view to the welfare of others.</b>

70
00:05:15.583 --> 00:05:21.208
<b>In such a society, instead of chasing</b>
<b>material pleasures and entertainment,</b>

71
00:05:21.208 --> 00:05:27.416
<b>people will consider inner peace and </b>
<b>spiritual growth as their goal.</b>

72
00:05:27.416 --> 00:05:31.541
<b>How beautiful is this imagination, right?</b>

73
00:05:31.541 --> 00:05:34.916
<b>Here, if you work for the welfare of others,</b>

74
00:05:34.916 --> 00:05:41.458
<b>then as a result, someone else will </b>
<b>also be working for your welfare.</b>

75
00:05:41.458 --> 00:05:42.833
<b>How much respect,</b>

76
00:05:42.833 --> 00:05:45.583
<b>love, and goodwill there will be in this society.</b>

77
00:05:45.583 --> 00:05:50.416
<b>Here, mutual relationships will be so sweet.</b>

78
00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:51.916
<b>Certainly,</b>

79
00:05:51.916 --> 00:05:55.083
<b>at this moment, it is an imagination.</b>

80
00:05:55.083 --> 00:06:00.958
<b>But some part of this imagination </b>
<b>can definitely be made true.</b>

81
00:06:00.958 --> 00:06:02.833
<b>Think about it,</b>

82
00:06:02.833 --> 00:06:05.958
<b>if you have good intentions for others,</b>

83
00:06:05.958 --> 00:06:10.541
<b>if you help them instead of using them,</b>

84
00:06:10.541 --> 00:06:12.541
<b>how much satisfaction you will get.</b>

85
00:06:12.541 --> 00:06:13.750
<b>Also,</b>

86
00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:18.416
<b>goodness is reciprocated with goodness.</b>

87
00:06:18.416 --> 00:06:23.791
<b>The beauty of your actions will </b>
<b>illuminate the mirror of others' hearts,</b>

88
00:06:23.791 --> 00:06:29.500
<b>and that very beauty will then reflect back </b>
<b>and brighten your life.</b>

89
00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:32.208
<b>Don't wait for someone else.</b>

90
00:06:32.208 --> 00:06:35.791
<b>Take the initiative towards such a society.</b>

91
00:06:35.791 --> 00:06:37.708
<b>Think about it.</b>

92
00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:45.583
<b>Imagine a workplace</b>

93
00:06:45.583 --> 00:06:49.000
<b>where everyone does their work truthfully,</b>

94
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:52.583
<b>without worrying about any personal reward.</b>

95
00:06:52.583 --> 00:06:58.125
<b>A workplace where working </b>
<b>with religious principles</b>

96
00:06:58.125 --> 00:07:04.583
<b>is considered as important as business success.</b>

97
00:07:04.583 --> 00:07:06.708
<b>A workplace where</b>

98
00:07:06.708 --> 00:07:11.458
<b>there is an atmosphere of mutual </b>
<b>cooperation among all colleagues,</b>

99
00:07:11.458 --> 00:07:16.458
<b>where they find satisfaction in their work.</b>

100
00:07:16.458 --> 00:07:18.875
<b>This workplace will be such that</b>

101
00:07:18.875 --> 00:07:22.666
<b>everyone will not only understand </b>
<b>the importance of their work,</b>

102
00:07:22.666 --> 00:07:25.708
<b>but will also understand</b>

103
00:07:25.708 --> 00:07:31.833
<b>how their contribution affects the </b>
<b>entire group, the entire organization.</b>

104
00:07:31.833 --> 00:07:35.166
<b>People working with such a perspective,</b>

105
00:07:35.166 --> 00:07:39.583
<b>moving away from personal </b>
<b>recognition and rewards,</b>

106
00:07:39.583 --> 00:07:43.208
<b>will work towards the goal of the organization.</b>

107
00:07:43.208 --> 00:07:45.125
<b>They will understand</b>

108
00:07:45.125 --> 00:07:51.166
<b>how this business organization is </b>
<b>making people's lives easier.</b>

109
00:07:51.166 --> 00:07:59.666
<b>People will see it as a part of social welfare, </b>
<b>a work that is higher.</b>

110
00:07:59.666 --> 00:08:02.125
<b>But</b>

111
00:08:02.125 --> 00:08:05.666
<b>how to do this?</b>

112
00:08:05.666 --> 00:08:07.000
<b>First of all,</b>

113
00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.875
<b>some things will have to be started.</b>

114
00:08:09.875 --> 00:08:11.625
<b>First.</b>

115
00:08:11.625 --> 00:08:17.666
<b>If an attempt is made to implement religious </b>
<b>principles in business organizations as well,</b>

116
00:08:17.666 --> 00:08:19.958
<b>it will definitely have some impact.</b>

117
00:08:19.958 --> 00:08:21.291
<b>Second.</b>

118
00:08:21.291 --> 00:08:27.208
<b>If the people leading that business not </b>
<b>only understand spiritual values,</b>

119
00:08:27.208 --> 00:08:31.583
<b>but also live them in their professional lives,</b>

120
00:08:31.583 --> 00:08:33.916
<b>it will inspire others as well.</b>

121
00:08:33.916 --> 00:08:35.833
<b>And third.</b>

122
00:08:35.833 --> 00:08:41.375
<b>The foundation of every business is to </b>
<b>make the lives of its customers easier.</b>

123
00:08:41.375 --> 00:08:45.291
<b>This is also human welfare.</b>

124
00:08:45.291 --> 00:08:47.500
<b>Awareness of this thinking</b>

125
00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:51.333
<b>will give a different perspective</b>
<b>to the people working there,</b>

126
00:08:51.333 --> 00:08:58.875
<b>encouraging them to see their work not </b>
<b>as a burden, but as a purpose.</b>

127
00:08:58.875 --> 00:09:05.541
<b>Propagation of religious values, emulation of </b>
<b>these values by people in leadership positions,</b>

128
00:09:05.541 --> 00:09:11.375
<b>awareness of the organization's </b>
<b>human welfare goals.</b>

129
00:09:11.375 --> 00:09:19.166
<b>All these will gradually help in creating a </b>
<b>beautiful professional environment.</b>

130
00:09:19.166 --> 00:09:20.916
<b>Think about it.</b>

